  {
   "key": "0x01",
   "name": "data write",
   "aliases": [
    "ICW2 ICW3 ICW4 OCW1"
   ],
   "access": "write",
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "406-426"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "437-485"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "499"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "508-512"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "641-647"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/pic8259.cpp",
     "function": "pic8259_device::write",
     "case": [
      "1"
     ]
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
     "function": "write_data"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "A write with A0 = 1 sets the mask byte OCW1.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "499",
       "sha": "68e3647c0624d98cb270a439acb3f4998fd5de894bb8a2dccdf50e146edb2eca"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "In an MCS 80/85 system the 8 levels call 8 locations 4 or 8 apart; the 8259A inserts the low address bits, the rest is programmed.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "406-412",
       "sha": "3efa36eaa211ec07d3c87655115d5b4beb3c66ef112652cd09cb3acc16995f86"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "413-418",
       "sha": "899e153731d141a73dfb16c256acef77a51d40f3e60c472215ad3ce69c72a536"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "In an 8086 system A15-A11 go in the top five bits of the vectoring byte and the 8259A sets the low three from the level.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "422-426",
       "sha": "bb76f3c428f6f448d6bfceb0c34f7ff3ecb7ff9ec2e72f5adb31b202b7f83973"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "ICW3 is written only when several 8259As are cascaded (SNGL = 0), and loads the 8-bit slave register.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "437-441",
       "sha": "8d500e494a0e97401b007a487b76c5da0478a6b5d7f59cf8ee976ffc20146112"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "6",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "In a master a 1 is set for each slave; the master releases byte 1 and enables the slave to release bytes 2 and 3.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "442-448",
       "sha": "94d969d682b18f02ff4d84aab3f430b91580d4b2ed379a4c09e727b9998770d5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "7",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "In a slave bits 2-0 identify it; it compares them with its cascade input and, if equal, releases bytes 2 and 3.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "449-454",
       "sha": "41f6a8c4f8aceb3046ba09be2417a046f9baf42a3e41781170b6e0d6ced96d4b"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "8",
     "on": "bit 4",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "SFNM = 1 programs the special fully nested mode.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "459-460",
       "sha": "561615758cc505b845b66bfa8ad2a52e082fc90bedf6321199dc9b4a94caccda"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "9",
     "on": "bit 3",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "BUF = 1 programs the buffered mode, in which SP/EN becomes an enable output and the master or slave role comes from M/S.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "461-464",
       "sha": "a555d10ef752be010aa786e3c2c6765f7ab00111d59d299dd2c100374dd3a0c5"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "10",
     "on": "bit 2",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "M/S = 1 programs a master and 0 a slave when buffered mode is selected; with BUF = 0 it has no function.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "465-469",
       "sha": "96da1b53e829ed85bf748c8a67bb7b65fce87d631e3577cb04091a1a2608d659"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "11",
     "on": "bit 1",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "AEOI = 1 programs the automatic end of interrupt mode.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "470-471",
       "sha": "636ddc3fc807251d96c3eb7aa0563dc9a70d32abb3440e35afe0729566af99cd"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "12",
     "on": "bit 0",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "mPM = 0 sets the 8259A for MCS-80, 85 system operation and mPM = 1 for 8086 system operation.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "472-475",
       "sha": "440fe047a4ade5fd8841b307128a394840335e92ba2da277f45bfb8103fd4694"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "13",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "OCW1 sets and clears the IMR mask bits: M7-M0 are the mask bits, 1 inhibits the channel and 0 enables it.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "508-512",
       "sha": "57dbdea0af8f2a415de3916cf94bfb704f0ac5cd884262c74a83207ee6d368a1"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "14",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Each request input can be masked individually through OCW1, bit 0 for IR0; masking a channel does not affect the others.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:8259A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "641-647",
       "sha": "24554afea8d4994af530741ac2fc0c2bdcaff601f177a5d29d04b0526c1c6118"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "101",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "7",
     "text": "The slave bits of ICW3 are tested together with m_master, so only a master acts on them in these lines.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/pic8259.cpp",
       "lines": "145-146",
       "sha": "e8c8cdcf96563a2ec0d0c05510a8020793b43f5b5123c009bc867c75ee64ed13"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/pic8259.cpp",
       "lines": "154-155",
       "sha": "e8c8cdcf96563a2ec0d0c05510a8020793b43f5b5123c009bc867c75ee64ed13"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "103",
     "on": "bit 2",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "10",
     "text": "The master or slave bit of ICW4 is stored in m_mode, and m_master is read from the SP input in the reset code.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/pic8259.cpp",
       "lines": "369",
       "sha": "d35c85e1f454f62b86162e758f77d27d47c55876839f190d6685ac143a9d08f4"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/pic8259.cpp",
       "lines": "455",
       "sha": "c0b449a8332b6a74a6f224ccc95f0857ba3bc40d6cf1feda40e08185dc2db7f3"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "201",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "2",
     "text": "MCS 80/85 mode is not handled: ICW4 with mPM = 0 only logs a message.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "329",
       "sha": "1131afad8cfbb21527ecec1b6d422a275a487e0824d8a912380ebb95879db444"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "202",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "5",
     "text": "ICW3 is accepted and logged, but its value is not stored, so no slave is identified.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "312-315",
       "sha": "8d9725397fdcbb641e6555581ad1cab9404021ef4fa88ac136e70c3d5a99c7aa"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "203",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "6",
     "text": "ICW3 is accepted and logged, but its value is not stored, so no slave bits are kept.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "312-315",
       "sha": "8d9725397fdcbb641e6555581ad1cab9404021ef4fa88ac136e70c3d5a99c7aa"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "204",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "7",
     "text": "ICW3 is accepted and logged, but its value is not stored, so a slave has no identity.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "312-315",
       "sha": "8d9725397fdcbb641e6555581ad1cab9404021ef4fa88ac136e70c3d5a99c7aa"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "205",
     "on": "bit 4",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "8",
     "text": "The special fully nested mode is not handled: ICW4 with SFNM = 1 only logs a message.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "330",
       "sha": "49b4e32fa318f52b58e194fe81d8fa4fca193d381d9dbda819a835633aa857df"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "206",
     "on": "bit 3",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "absent",
     "row": "9",
     "text": "The buffered mode bit of ICW4 is not decoded: only a comment describes it.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "316-324",
       "sha": "434e2c470d757c19b4e35da22f0d89f13abcd03af9ebde64b3f32cb5e18543dd"
      },
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "325-333",
       "sha": "822fadcfaaf347cb0bfa16cf116d32ef3376d3fa86822e8f5e914a8756a98288"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "207",
     "on": "bit 2",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "absent",
     "row": "10",
     "text": "The master or slave bit of ICW4 is not decoded: only a comment describes it.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "316-324",
       "sha": "434e2c470d757c19b4e35da22f0d89f13abcd03af9ebde64b3f32cb5e18543dd"
      },
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "325-333",
       "sha": "822fadcfaaf347cb0bfa16cf116d32ef3376d3fa86822e8f5e914a8756a98288"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "208",
     "on": "bit 0",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "12",
     "text": "mPM = 0 only logs that 8085 mode is not handled.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "329",
       "sha": "1131afad8cfbb21527ecec1b6d422a275a487e0824d8a912380ebb95879db444"
      }
     ]
    }
